1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:18,000
A place can be new. The habits we bring to it are older.

2
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:28,000
We carry them in the pace of a walk. In what we pass without looking.

3
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Then something ordinary interrupts us.

4
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:52,000
A line of light. A doorway. The time it takes for a wave to disappear.

5
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Perhaps being somewhere else begins here: with noticing what was already there.
